## Code quality

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `dude lint` | Run all structural MCP checks (layout, component placement, naming, …) |
| `dude format` | Format the server with `ruff` (format + import sort) |
| `dude review` | Run `dude lint` + `ruff check` + `mypy --strict` in one pass |
| `dude upgrade` | Update the pinned `dude` CLI and stack versions for this project |

The MCP rules enforced by `dude lint` are documented in
[Architecture](architecture.md) and in `.claude/rules/MCP/`.

