## Testing

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `dude test` | Run the pytest suite (unit + in-memory MCP integration) |
| `dude test --k <expr>` | Only run tests matching a pytest `-k` expression |

Tests run inside the `fastmcp` container when it's up, otherwise against a local
`uv` virtualenv.

